00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:04,441
You add a twenty-five percent markup. So what's your margin?

2
00:00:04,561 --> 00:00:09,546
Cost AED 100. You sell at AED 125.

3
00:00:09,666 --> 00:00:13,964
Is the margin 25, 20 or 30 percent?

4
00:00:16,484 --> 00:00:18,214
It's 20 percent.

5
00:00:18,334 --> 00:00:21,309
Same AED 25 of profit.

6
00:00:21,429 --> 00:00:24,407
Divide by cost: markup.

7
00:00:24,527 --> 00:00:27,564
Divide by price: margin.

8
00:00:27,684 --> 00:00:34,682
Our accounting & MIS advisory keeps the two apart.

